(733, 446, '_elementor_data', '[{"id":"76ff7e48","elType":"container","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"38b7272e","elType":"widget","settings":{"eyebrow":"Une <strong>Escouade<\\/strong>, c\\u2019est <em>plus qu\\u2019une \\u00e9quipe<\\/em> :","title":"c\\u2019est une aventure humaine","button_text":"Rejoindre l\\u2019aventure","button_link":{"url":"#je-cherche-un-job","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-hero-text"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"1e084d42","elType":"container","settings":{"css_classes":"block"},"elements":[{"id":"4edd0fca","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"Qui sommes-nous","text":"<p>Chez Escouade, nous croyons que la r\\u00e9ussite d\\u2019un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.<\\/p><p>Bas\\u00e9e \\u00e0 Madagascar, notre soci\\u00e9t\\u00e9 r\\u00e9unit des d\\u00e9veloppeurs passionn\\u00e9s et les connecte \\u00e0 des projets stimulants port\\u00e9s par nos partenaires en Europe.<\\/p><p>Plus qu\\u2019un simple recrutement, nous cr\\u00e9ons de v\\u00e9ritables escouades : des \\u00e9quipes soud\\u00e9es, humaines et performantes.<\\/p>","button_text":"","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":436,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/edito-img-1.png"},"transparent_background":"yes"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"d475e75","elType":"container","settings":{"css_classes":"block bgi bgi--4"},"elements":[{"id":"3b4b6d68","elType":"aura-carousel","settings":{"content_width":"full","carousel_name":"Carrousel","slides_to_show":"1","autoplay_interval":"","transition_duration":100,"overflow":"hidden","autoplay":"","background_background":"gradient","background_color":"#FFFFFF80","background_color_stop":{"unit":"%","size":39.56,"sizes":[]},"background_color_b":"#FFFFFFE6","background_color_b_stop":{"unit":"%","size":74.55,"sizes":[]},"background_gradient_angle":{"unit":"deg","size":316,"sizes":[]},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"1","right":"1","bottom":"1","left":"1","isLinked":true},"border_color":"#FFFFFF","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"24","right":"24","bottom":"24","left":"24","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"25","right":"0","bottom":"25","left":"0","isLinked":false},"show_arrows":"","show_pagination":"","slides_to_show_tablet":"1"},"elements":[{"id":"1bb17ec0","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Les technologies <em>Frontend<\\/em>","subtitle":"au c\\u0153ur de nos r\\u00e9alisations","technologies":[{"name":"React","logo":{"id":437,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/tech-logo-react-icon.png"},"_id":"ea8af0f"},{"name":"Vue.js","logo":{"id":438,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/tech-logo-vue.js.png"},"_id":"c1e3d31"},{"name":"jQuery","logo":{"id":439,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/tech-logo-nodejs.png"},"_id":"5c9fb30"},{"name":"Ionic","logo":{"id":440,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/tech-logo-ionic.png"},"_id":"294f7db"},{"name":"Flutter","logo":{"id":441,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/tech-logo-ionic-1.png"},"_id":"55ebb39"},{"name":"Angular","logo":{"id":442,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/logo-angular.png"},"_id":"ce357a2"},{"_id":"a2b85af","logo":{"id":443,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/Tailwind_CSS_Logo.svg_.png"},"name":"Tailwind"}]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-tech-slider-card"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"8b5bb52","elType":"container","settings":{"css_classes":"block"},"elements":[{"id":"7c5e97c7","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"L\\u2019\\u00e9quipe Escouade, au c\\u0153ur de nos missions","text":"<p>Rejoindre Escouade, c\\u2019est int\\u00e9grer plus qu\\u2019une entreprise : c\\u2019est faire partie d\\u2019une \\u00e9quipe soud\\u00e9e o\\u00f9 la passion pour la tech se vit au quotidien.<\\/p><p>Nos talents collaborent sur des projets stimulants men\\u00e9s avec nos partenaires en Europe, dans un environnement qui valorise les comp\\u00e9tences autant que l\\u2019\\u00e9quilibre vie pro\\/vie perso.<\\/p><p>Ici, chaque mission est une aventure collective, une escouade o\\u00f9 tu peux progresser, partager et construire ton avenir.<\\/p>","button_text":"D\\u00e9couvrir nos opportunit\\u00e9s","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":444,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/equipe-soudee.jpg"},"transparent_background":"yes","button_link":{"url":"\\/carriere-it-madagascar\\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"theme":"pink_blue"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"},{"id":"17e1b35f","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"Composez l\\u2019escouade qui fera avancer vos projets.","text":"<p>Chez Escouade, nous accompagnons les entreprises en Europe dans la cr\\u00e9ation d\\u2019\\u00e9quipes IT d\\u00e9di\\u00e9es et performantes.<\\/p><p>Nos talents couvrent un large \\u00e9ventail de comp\\u00e9tences : d\\u00e9veloppement web et applicatif (Java, .NET, PHP, JS, Python), QA, PO.<\\/p><p>Chaque profil est s\\u00e9lectionn\\u00e9 avec soin pour rejoindre une escouade adapt\\u00e9e \\u00e0 vos besoins, avec un suivi humain, r\\u00e9actif et transparent.<\\/p><p>Plus qu\\u2019un simple service de recrutement, nous b\\u00e2tissons des partenariats durables, o\\u00f9 la proximit\\u00e9 et la qualit\\u00e9 sont au centre de nos engagements.<\\/p><p>Contactez-nous sur <a href=\\"mailto:contact@escouade.mg\\">contact@escouade.mg<\\/a><\\/p>","button_text":"","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":445,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/equipe-soudee-1.jpg"},"transparent_background":"yes","button_link":{"url":"\\/carriere-it-madagascar\\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"image_position":"right","theme":"blue_green"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"23a06256","elType":"container","settings":{"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"00","right":"00","bottom":"00","left":"00","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"7a11df68","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Rejoignez votre Escouade","button_label":"Voir toutes les offres d\\u2019emploi","button_link":{"url":"\\/offres-d-emploi\\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-job-advertising"}],"isInner":false}]'),
