ground_overlay_hover_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_overlay_hover_slideshow_gallery":[]},"elements":[{"id":"7c5e97c7","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"L\\u2019\\u00e9quipe Escouade, au c\\u0153ur de nos missions","text":"<p>Rejoindre Escouade, c\\u2019est int\\u00e9grer plus qu\\u2019une entreprise : c\\u2019est faire partie d\\u2019une \\u00e9quipe soud\\u00e9e o\\u00f9 la passion pour la tech se vit au quotidien.<\\/p><p>Nos talents collaborent sur des projets stimulants men\\u00e9s avec nos partenaires en Europe, dans un environnement qui valorise les comp\\u00e9tences autant que l\\u2019\\u00e9quilibre vie pro\\/vie perso.<\\/p><p>Ici, chaque mission est une aventure collective, une escouade o\\u00f9 tu peux progresser, partager et construire ton avenir.<\\/p>","button_text":"D\\u00e9couvrir nos opportunit\\u00e9s","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":444,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/equipe-soudee.jpg"},"transparent_background":"yes","button_link":{"url":"\\/carriere-it-madagascar\\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"theme":"pink_blue","_background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_slideshow_gallery":[],"_background_hover_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_hover_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_hover_slideshow_gallery":[],"_mask_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"},{"id":"17e1b35f","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"Composez l\\u2019escouade qui fera avancer vos projets.","text":"<p>Chez Escouade, nous accompagnons les entreprises en Europe dans la cr\\u00e9ation d\\u2019\\u00e9quipes IT d\\u00e9di\\u00e9es et performantes.<\\/p><p>Nos talents couvrent un large \\u00e9ventail de comp\\u00e9tences : d\\u00e9veloppement web et applicatif (Java, .NET, PHP, JS, Python), QA, PO.<\\/p><p>Chaque profil est s\\u00e9lectionn\\u00e9 avec soin pour rejoindre une escouade adapt\\u00e9e \\u00e0 vos besoins, avec un suivi humain, r\\u00e9actif et transparent.<\\/p><p>Plus qu\\u2019un simple service de recrutement, nous b\\u00e2tissons des partenariats durables, o\\u00f9 la proximit\\u00e9 et la qualit\\u00e9 sont au centre de nos engagements.<\\/p><p>Contactez-nous sur <a href=\\"mailto:contact@escouade.mg\\">contact@escouade.mg<\\/a><\\/p>","button_text":"","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":445,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/equipe-soudee-1.jpg"},"transparent_background":"yes","button_link":{"url":"\\/carriere-it-madagascar\\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"image_position":"right","theme":"blue_green","_background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_slideshow_gallery":[],"_background_hover_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_hover_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"_background_hover_slideshow_gallery":[],"_mask_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"23a06256","elType":"container","settings":{"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"00","right":"00","bottom":"00","left":"00","isLinked":true},"background_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_slideshow_gallery":[],"background_hover_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_hover_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_hover_slideshow_gallery":[],"background_overlay_image":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_overlay_video_fallback":{"url":"","id":"","size":""},"background_overlay_slideshow_gallery":[],"background_overlay_hover_image":{