(1127, 482, '_elementor_data', '[{"id":"ec6a46c","elType":"container","settings":{"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"00","right":"00","bottom":"00","left":"00","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"e1a64b9","elType":"widget","settings":{"eyebrow":"Une <strong>Escouade<\\/strong>, c\\u2019est <em>plus qu\\u2019une \\u00e9quipe<\\/em> :","title":"c\\u2019est une aventure humaine","button_text":"Rejoindre l\\u2019aventure","button_link":{"url":"#je-cherche-un-job","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-hero-text"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"cc56252","elType":"container","settings":{"css_classes":"block"},"elements":[{"id":"01f558f","elType":"widget","settings":{"badge":"","title":"Qui sommes-nous","text":"<p>Chez Escouade, nous croyons que la r\\u00e9ussite d\\u2019un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.<\\/p>\\n<p>Bas\\u00e9e \\u00e0 Madagascar, notre soci\\u00e9t\\u00e9 r\\u00e9unit des d\\u00e9veloppeurs passionn\\u00e9s et les connecte \\u00e0 des projets stimulants port\\u00e9s par nos partenaires en Europe.<\\/p>\\n<p>Plus qu\\u2019un simple recrutement, nous cr\\u00e9ons de v\\u00e9ritables escouades : des \\u00e9quipes soud\\u00e9es, humaines et performantes.<\\/p>","button_text":"","show_card_background":"","image":{"id":436,"url":"http:\\/\\/escouade.localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/09\\/edito-img-1.png"},"transparent_background":"yes"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"aura-edito"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"a5e6bc4","elType":"container","settings":{"css_classes":"block bgi bgi--4"},"elements":[{"id":"5ba5948","elType":"aura-carousel","settings":{"content_width":"full","carousel_name":"Carrousel","slides_to_show":"1","autoplay_interval":"","transition_duration":100,"overflow":"hidden","autoplay":"","background_background":"gradient","background_col