(13, 3, '2026-03-27 22:37:19', '2026-03-27 22:37:19', '<h1>\n                                                    <small>Une <strong>Escouade</strong>, c’est <em>plus qu’une équipe</em> :</small>\n                                                                            c’est une aventure humaine\n                                            </h1>\n                        <a href="#je-cherche-un-job" title="Rejoindre l’aventure">Rejoindre l’aventure </a>\n                        <figure>\n                                                            <img width="576" height="414" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/edito-img-1.png" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/edito-img-1.png 576w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/edito-img-1-300x216.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" />                                                    </figure>\n                                                                            <h2>Qui sommes-nous</h2>\n                                                <p>Chez Escouade, nous croyons que la réussite d’un projet repose avant tout sur les personnes.</p>\n<p>Basée à Madagascar, notre société réunit des développeurs passionnés et les connecte à des projets stimulants portés par nos partenaires en Europe.</p>\n<p>Plus qu’un simple recrutement, nous créons de véritables escouades : des équipes soudées, humaines et performantes.</p>\n            <h2>\n                                    Les technologies <em>Frontend</em>\n                                                    <small >au cœur de nos réalisations</small>\n                            </h2>\n            <ul>\n                <li>\n                    <button type="button" data-uk-slider-item="previous" aria-label="Slide précédente">\n                    </button>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <button type="button" data-uk-slider-item="next" aria-label="Slide suivante">\n                    </button>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <ul>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="90" height="80" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-react-icon.png" alt="logo react" decoding="async" />                                                                    \n                                                        <figcaption >React</figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                    </li>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="92" height="80" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/tech-logo-vue.js.png" alt="" decoding="async" />                                                                    \n                                                        <figcaption >Vue.js</figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                    </li>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="582" height="541" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jquery.png" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jquery.png 582w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/jquery-300x279.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 582px) 100vw, 582px" />                                                                    \n                                                        <figcaption >jQuery</figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                    </li>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="82" height="80" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-ionic.png" alt="logo ionic" decoding="async" />                                                                    \n                                                        <figcaption >Ionic</figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                    </li>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="64" height="80" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/tech-logo-flutter.png" alt="logo flutter" decoding="async" />                                                                    \n                                                        <figcaption >Flutter</figcaption>\n                        </figure>\n                    </li>\n                                                        <li>\n                        <figure>\n                                                                            <img width="1920" height="1920" src="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular.png" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular.png 1920w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular-300x300.png 300w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular-1024x1024.png 1024w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular-150x150.png 150w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular-768x768.png 768w, http://escouade.localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-angular-1536x1536.png 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" />                                                                    \n     